    <label>nine-turns pill</label>
    <description>A golden pill turned in the furnace nine times over nine days. Legend says Shennong's last disciple refined the first one, and that the ninth turn calls down a small tribulation that only a level 3 alchemy furnace can withstand. Brewed from spirit ginseng root, snow lotus petals and a spirit crystal, it floods the dantian with qi (much more with higher quality) and leaves heavy toxicity.</description>
